{"seq":10,"slug":"developmental-biology","title":"发育生物学","stage":"DONE","category":"biology-life-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 发育生物学\n\n一颗直径不到 0.1 毫米的受精卵，在不到一年的时间里变成由数十万亿细胞、上百种不同类型、上千个精密器官组成的个体——这件事每天都在发生，却始终是生命科学里最令人震撼的谜题。发育生物学要回答的核心问题只有一个：同一份基因组，如何在不同的细胞里被读出不同的内容，从而让一团相同的细胞分化出皮肤、神经、心脏与骨骼，并把它们摆放到正确的位置上。\n\n这个 hub 沿着「单个受精卵成长为复杂个体」这条主线，把发育生物学拆成四条递进的脉络。第一条是「基础」：从核心概念与模式生物讲起，进入配子发生与受精如何启动新生命，再到卵裂与原肠胚形成如何在几天内搭出三个胚层的雏形。没有这一层的时空坐标系，后面的一切都无从谈起。\n\n第二条脉络是「模式形成机制」，这是发育生物学的理论心脏。一团看似均匀的细胞如何知道哪里是头、哪里是尾，哪里该长出肢体？答案藏在体轴的建立、形态发生素浓度梯度所携带的位置信息，以及少数几条反复使用的信号通路如何把这些信息翻译成细胞命运。本章把 Hox 基因、法国国旗模型、Wnt 与 Notch 这些概念集中讲透。\n\n第三条脉络是「器官发生」，把抽象的模式落到具体的结构上：上皮如何折叠成管、间充质如何分支、神经管如何卷起又分化出整个中枢神经系统，以及肢体这一经典模型系统，连带它背后最迷人的问题——为什么蝾螈能再生整条腿而人类不能。\n\n第四条脉络是「前沿」，呈现这门学科在 2026 年的活跃边界：用干细胞自组装出类器官乃至合成胚胎模型，用演化发育生物学（Evo-Devo）解释身体蓝图如何在亿万年间被改写，以及单细胞与空间转录组学如何把整个人类胚胎的发育以单细胞分辨率绘成图谱。\n\n四条脉络层层递进：基础给出舞台与时间轴，机制给出规则，器官发生给出产物，前沿则展示我们如何重写规则、并把这门古老学科带入数据驱动的新时代。建议初学者按章节顺序阅读，每篇文档都会在提到由其它篇主讲的概念时给出交叉链接，方便你在这张知识网中往返穿行。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intro-and-core-concepts","title":"发育生物学导论与核心概念","url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/foundations/intro-and-core-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gametogenesis-fertilization","title":"配子发生与受精","url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/foundations/gametogenesis-fertilization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cleavage-gastrulation","title":"卵裂与原肠胚形成","url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/foundations/cleavage-gastrulation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"patterning-mechanisms","title":"模式形成机制","docCount":3,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/patterning-mechanisms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"axis-formation-body-plan","title":"体轴形成与身体蓝图","url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/patterning-mechanisms/axis-formation-body-plan"},{"seq":2,"slug":"morphogens-positional-information","title":"形态发生素与位置信息","url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/patterning-mechanisms/morphogens-positional-information"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cell-fate-signaling","title":"细胞命运决定与信号通路","url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/patterning-mechanisms/cell-fate-signaling"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"organogenesis","title":"器官发生","docCount":3,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/organogenesis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"organogenesis-overview","title":"器官发生概览","url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/organogenesis/organogenesis-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"neural-development","title":"神经发育","url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/organogenesis/neural-development"},{"seq":3,"slug":"limb-and-regeneration","title":"肢体发育与再生","url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/organogenesis/limb-and-regeneration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"frontiers","title":"前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/frontiers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stem-cells-organoids","title":"干细胞与类器官","url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/frontiers/stem-cells-organoids"},{"seq":2,"slug":"evo-devo","title":"演化发育生物学（Evo-Devo）","url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/frontiers/evo-devo"},{"seq":3,"slug":"single-cell-developmental-frontiers","title":"单细胞与发育生物学前沿","url":"/h/biology-life-science/developmental-biology/frontiers/single-cell-developmental-frontiers"}]}]}